{"title":"Career Roadmap · QA Tester","role":"QA Tester","summary":"A QA Tester verifies that software applications work correctly, meet business requirements, remain reliable after changes, and provide an acceptable user experience. The role involves test planning, test-case design, functional testing, API testing, regression testing, defect reporting, automation and quality engineering.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1 UG · 2026","Current degree":"BCA – Software Testing / QA"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"QA Intern, Software Testing Intern, Manual Tester, QA Trainee"},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"How should I specialise?","output":"QA Tester, Test Engineer, Automation Tester, QA Automation Engineer"},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Senior QA Engineer, SDET, Test Automation Lead, Quality Engineer"},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How can I remain relevant?","output":"QA Lead, Quality Engineering Manager, Test Architect, Engineering Quality Lead"}],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a BCA student specialising in Software Testing / QA, this is a very strong alignment. The student should progress from manual testing fundamentals toward automation, API testing, CI/CD, performance testing and quality engineering."}]},{"heading":"Career-route check","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Very strong alignment."},{"type":"p","text":"A practical route is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BCA","QA Internship","QA Tester / Test Engineer","Automation QA Engineer","Senior QA Engineer","QA Lead / SDET / Quality Engineering Lead"]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Software fundamentals, SDLC, testing basics, Git"},{"text":"ISTQB · GitHub Skills","url":"https://www.istqb.org/"},{"text":"Test cases for sample applications"},{"text":"QA foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Manual testing, test design, defect management, SQL"},{"text":"Official documentation + practice projects"},{"text":"Test plan + defect reports"},{"text":"Manual QA"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Web testing, API testing, Postman, HTTP"},{"text":"Postman Learning Center","url":"https://learning.postman.com/"},{"text":"API test collection"},{"text":"Technical QA"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"Selenium/Playwright, programming, automation"},{"text":"Selenium Documentation · Playwright","url":"https://www.selenium.dev/documentation/"},{"text":"Automated regression suite"},{"text":"Automation"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Framework design, CI/CD, Docker, GitHub Actions"},{"text":"Official tool documentation"},{"text":"CI automated tests"},{"text":"Engineering maturity"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Performance, security, mobile and database testing"},{"text":"Tool documentation + labs"},{"text":"Performance/API/database test project"},{"text":"Advanced testing"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Internship + automation portfolio"},{"text":"Industry projects"},{"text":"Internship + test framework"},{"text":"Job readiness"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"SDET/QA interviews, system understanding, portfolio"},{"text":"Practice + official resources"},{"text":"Resume + 3–5 QA projects"},{"text":"Placement readiness"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Core QA technical stack"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Software development lifecycle"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SDLC"},{"text":"STLC"},{"text":"Requirements"},{"text":"Development"},{"text":"Testing"},{"text":"Deployment"},{"text":"Maintenance"},{"text":"Agile"},{"text":"Scrum"},{"text":"DevOps"},{"text":"CI/CD"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand where QA participates:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Requirement","Test Planning","Test Design","Test Execution","Defect Management","Regression","Release","Production Monitoring"]}]},{"heading":"Manual testing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Functional testing"},{"text":"Regression testing"},{"text":"Smoke testing"},{"text":"Sanity testing"},{"text":"Integration testing"},{"text":"System testing"},{"text":"End-to-end testing"},{"text":"Exploratory testing"},{"text":"Acceptance testing"},{"text":"Compatibility testing"},{"text":"Usability testing"},{"text":"Negative testing"},{"text":"Boundary testing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A beginner should understand why a test is designed, not simply execute pre-written steps."}]},{"heading":"Test-case design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Equivalence partitioning"},{"text":"Boundary-value analysis"},{"text":"Decision tables"},{"text":"State-transition testing"},{"text":"Pairwise testing"},{"text":"Use-case testing"},{"text":"Risk-based testing"},{"text":"Exploratory testing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"For an age field accepting 18–60, don't test only:"},{"type":"p","text":"25"},{"type":"p","text":"Also consider:"},{"type":"p","text":"17, 18, 19, 59, 60, 61, blank, text, negative value, decimal"},{"type":"p","text":"This demonstrates actual test-design thinking."}]},{"heading":"Defect management","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to write professional bugs."},{"type":"p","text":"A good defect report contains:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Title","Environment","Preconditions","Steps","Expected Result","Actual Result","Severity","Priority","Evidence"]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Severity"},{"type":"p","text":"How badly the defect affects the system."},{"type":"h","text":"Priority"},{"type":"p","text":"How urgently the business should fix it."},{"type":"p","text":"These are not always the same."},{"type":"p","text":"Tools:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Jira"},{"text":"Azure DevOps"},{"text":"Bugzilla"},{"text":"GitHub Issues"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Atlassian Jira","url":"https://www.atlassian.com/software/jira"}]},{"heading":"SQL and database testing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A QA engineer should understand databases."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"WHERE"},{"text":"JOIN"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"Subqueries"},{"text":"CTEs"},{"text":"Constraints"},{"text":"Transactions"},{"text":"CRUD"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Referential integrity"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Test:"},{"type":"flow","items":["UI","API","Database"]},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"p","text":"A user creates an account through the UI."},{"type":"p","text":"QA should be able to verify:"},{"type":"flow","items":["UI result","API response","database record"]}]},{"heading":"API testing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"API testing is highly valuable for modern QA roles."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HTTP methods"},{"text":"GET"},{"text":"POST"},{"text":"PUT"},{"text":"PATCH"},{"text":"DELETE"},{"text":"Status codes"},{"text":"Headers"},{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"JSON"},{"text":"Request/response validation"},{"text":"Schema validation"},{"text":"Error handling"},{"text":"Rate limiting"},{"text":"API security basics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"p","text":"Postman Learning Center","url":"https://learning.postman.com/"},{"type":"p","text":"Build collections with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Positive tests"},{"text":"Negative tests"},{"text":"Boundary cases"},{"text":"Authentication tests"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Regression tests"}]}]},{"heading":"Automation testing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After manual testing fundamentals, learn automation."},{"type":"h","text":"Web automation"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one primary framework:"},{"type":"p","text":"Selenium or Playwright"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Locators"},{"text":"Assertions"},{"text":"Waits"},{"text":"Page Object Model"},{"text":"Test fixtures"},{"text":"Data-driven testing"},{"text":"Screenshots"},{"text":"Reports"},{"text":"Parallel execution"},{"text":"Test organisation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Selenium Documentation\nPlaywright","url":"https://www.selenium.dev/documentation/"}]},{"heading":"Programming","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A QA student should learn at least one programming language well."},{"type":"p","text":"Recommended:"},{"type":"h","text":"Java"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Selenium"},{"text":"Enterprise QA"},{"text":"SDET roles"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Python"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pytest"},{"text":"API automation"},{"text":"Test utilities"},{"text":"Data testing"},{"text":"Automation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"JavaScript/TypeScript"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Playwright"},{"text":"Modern web testing"},{"text":"Frontend-heavy teams"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The goal is not to become a full-time developer."},{"type":"p","text":"The goal is:"},{"type":"p","text":"Write maintainable automated tests and understand application code."}]},{"heading":"Pytest / JUnit / TestNG","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Depending on the language:"},{"type":"h","text":"Python"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"pytest"},{"text":"unittest"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Java"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"JUnit"},{"text":"TestNG"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Assertions"},{"text":"Fixtures"},{"text":"Parameterisation"},{"text":"Setup/teardown"},{"text":"Test suites"},{"text":"Reports"},{"text":"Mocking"}]}]},{"heading":"CI/CD","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Modern QA should understand how tests run automatically."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Git"},{"text":"GitHub"},{"text":"GitHub Actions"},{"text":"Jenkins"},{"text":"CI/CD pipelines"},{"text":"Build triggers"},{"text":"Automated regression"},{"text":"Test reports"},{"text":"Environment variables"},{"text":"Docker basics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A mature workflow is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Code commit","Build","Automated tests","Report","Deployment decision"]}]},{"heading":"Performance testing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Load testing"},{"text":"Stress testing"},{"text":"Spike testing"},{"text":"Endurance testing"},{"text":"Response time"},{"text":"Throughput"},{"text":"Concurrent users"},{"text":"Resource utilisation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Tools:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"JMeter"},{"text":"k6"},{"text":"Gatling"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Start with a basic performance-testing project rather than trying to master every tool."}]},{"heading":"Mobile testing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Android testing"},{"text":"iOS testing concepts"},{"text":"Different screen sizes"},{"text":"Network conditions"},{"text":"Permissions"},{"text":"App lifecycle"},{"text":"Installation/update testing"},{"text":"Offline behaviour"},{"text":"Notifications"},{"text":"Device compatibility"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Tools can include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Appium"},{"text":"Android Studio"},{"text":"Browser/device testing platforms"}]}]},{"heading":"Security-aware QA","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A QA tester does not need to become a penetration tester, but should recognise common security risks."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"Authorisation"},{"text":"Session management"},{"text":"Input validation"},{"text":"Sensitive data exposure"},{"text":"Secure password handling"},{"text":"Basic OWASP concepts"},{"text":"API security fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use intentionally vulnerable applications for learning."},{"type":"p","text":"OWASP","url":"https://owasp.org/"},{"type":"h","text":"Projects to build"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — E-commerce Manual Testing"},{"type":"p","text":"Test a sample e-commerce application."},{"type":"p","text":"Create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Test plan"},{"text":"Test scenarios"},{"text":"100+ test cases"},{"text":"Bug reports"},{"text":"Regression suite"},{"text":"Test summary report"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — API Testing Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose a public or locally created API."},{"type":"p","text":"Test:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"CRUD"},{"text":"Positive cases"},{"text":"Negative cases"},{"text":"Boundary cases"},{"text":"Response schema"},{"text":"Status codes"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Create a professional Postman collection."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Selenium/Playwright Automation Framework"},{"type":"p","text":"Build an automation framework containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Login"},{"text":"Product search"},{"text":"Product selection"},{"text":"Cart"},{"text":"Checkout"},{"text":"Logout"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Page Object Model"},{"text":"Fixtures"},{"text":"Assertions"},{"text":"Screenshots"},{"text":"Reports"},{"text":"Configuration"},{"text":"Test data"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Database Testing"},{"type":"p","text":"Create:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Web Application","API","Database"]},{"type":"p","text":"Test whether:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UI data reaches API"},{"text":"API validates input"},{"text":"Database stores correct information"},{"text":"Updates are reflected correctly"},{"text":"Invalid data is rejected"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — CI/CD QA Pipeline"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"flow","items":["GitHub","CI pipeline","automated tests","test report"]},{"type":"p","text":"Run the suite automatically whenever code changes."},{"type":"p","text":"This is a particularly strong project for moving from manual QA → QA automation/SDET."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Senior role it leads to"],"rows":[[{"text":"Manual QA"},{"text":"Test design, functional testing, Jira"},{"text":"Senior QA Tester"}],[{"text":"Automation QA"},{"text":"Selenium/Playwright + programming"},{"text":"Senior Automation Engineer"}],[{"text":"SDET"},{"text":"Programming + testing + CI/CD"},{"text":"Staff/Senior SDET"}],[{"text":"API Testing"},{"text":"REST, Postman, automation"},{"text":"API QA Specialist"}],[{"text":"Performance Testing"},{"text":"JMeter/k6, monitoring"},{"text":"Performance Test Engineer"}],[{"text":"Mobile QA"},{"text":"Appium, Android/iOS"},{"text":"Mobile QA Lead"}],[{"text":"Security QA"},{"text":"OWASP, API/security testing"},{"text":"Application Security QA"}],[{"text":"Data/ETL Testing"},{"text":"SQL, Python, data pipelines"},{"text":"Data Quality Engineer"}],[{"text":"DevOps/Quality Engineering"},{"text":"CI/CD, Docker, automation"},{"text":"Quality Engineering Lead"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Government / public-sector / research"},{"type":"table","header":["Organisation/type","What to target"],"rows":[[{"text":"NIC"},{"text":"Government software testing and quality projects"}],[{"text":"STQC"},{"text":"Software quality, testing and certification-related exposure"}],[{"text":"Government IT projects"},{"text":"Functional/API/database testing"}],[{"text":"ISRO"},{"text":"Software testing and validation where opportunities are available"}],[{"text":"DRDO"},{"text":"Software testing and engineering projects where available"}],[{"text":"CSIR laboratories"},{"text":"Research software validation/testing"}],[{"text":"University/IIT/IISc labs"},{"text":"Software quality and research-tool testing"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful official resources:"},{"type":"p","text":"STQC\nNIC\nISRO Careers\nDRDO\nCSIR","url":"https://www.stqc.gov.in/"},{"type":"p","text":"Current internship availability and eligibility should be verified from official notifications."},{"type":"h","text":"Private / industry"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Software companies"},{"text":"SaaS companies"},{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"Banking technology"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Health-tech"},{"text":"EdTech"},{"text":"IT services"},{"text":"Product companies"},{"text":"Gaming"},{"text":"Telecom"},{"text":"Consulting"},{"text":"Startups"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example employers to research:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"TCS","url":"https://www.tcs.com/"},{"text":"Infosys","url":"https://www.infosys.com/"},{"text":"Wipro","url":"https://www.wipro.com/"},{"text":"Accenture","url":"https://www.accenture.com/"},{"text":"Cognizant","url":"https://www.cognizant.com/"},{"text":"Capgemini","url":"https://www.capgemini.com/"},{"text":"Microsoft","url":"https://www.microsoft.com/"},{"text":"Amazon Jobs","url":"https://www.amazon.jobs/"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Search for:"},{"type":"p","text":"QA Intern · Software Testing Intern · Test Engineer Intern · QA Automation Intern · SDET Intern · Quality Engineer Intern"}]},{"heading":"Certifications in demand","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Certification / learning area","Why it helps"],"rows":[[{"text":"ISTQB Foundation Level (CTFL)"},{"text":"Recognised testing foundation"}],[{"text":"ISTQB Agile Tester"},{"text":"Agile testing"}],[{"text":"ISTQB Test Automation Engineer"},{"text":"Advanced automation pathway"}],[{"text":"Selenium/Playwright training"},{"text":"Web automation"}],[{"text":"Postman/API testing training"},{"text":"API capability"}],[{"text":"SQL certification"},{"text":"Database testing"}],[{"text":"JMeter/k6 training"},{"text":"Performance testing"}],[{"text":"Appium training"},{"text":"Mobile automation"}],[{"text":"Jira/Agile training"},{"text":"Team workflow"}],[{"text":"Git/GitHub training"},{"text":"Engineering workflow"}],[{"text":"Docker/CI/CD training"},{"text":"Quality engineering"}],[{"text":"Python/Java certification"},{"text":"Automation programming"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For a fresh graduate, ISTQB Foundation + strong automation projects is a reasonable combination, but certification alone does not demonstrate practical QA ability."}]},{"heading":"Careers you can be hired as","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Realistic first-job titles"},{"type":"table","header":["Role","Stack the posting asks for","Where the student proves it"],"rows":[[{"text":"QA Tester"},{"text":"Manual testing, SDLC, defect management"},{"text":"Testing portfolio"}],[{"text":"QA Engineer Trainee"},{"text":"Testing + programming basics"},{"text":"QA projects"}],[{"text":"Software Tester"},{"text":"Test cases, regression, bugs"},{"text":"Test plan"}],[{"text":"QA Intern"},{"text":"Testing fundamentals"},{"text":"Internship"}],[{"text":"Test Engineer"},{"text":"Functional/API testing"},{"text":"API + web testing"}],[{"text":"Manual Tester"},{"text":"Test design, execution, Jira"},{"text":"Manual testing project"}],[{"text":"QA Automation Intern"},{"text":"Selenium/Playwright"},{"text":"Automation framework"}],[{"text":"Junior Automation Tester"},{"text":"Programming + automation"},{"text":"Automated suite"}],[{"text":"Automation QA Engineer"},{"text":"Frameworks + CI/CD"},{"text":"CI automation project"}],[{"text":"SDET Trainee"},{"text":"Programming + testing"},{"text":"End-to-end framework"}],[{"text":"API Test Engineer"},{"text":"REST, Postman, automation"},{"text":"API project"}],[{"text":"Mobile QA Tester"},{"text":"Mobile testing, Appium"},{"text":"Mobile testing project"}],[{"text":"Performance Test Trainee"},{"text":"JMeter/k6"},{"text":"Performance project"}],[{"text":"Quality Engineer"},{"text":"Automation + engineering"},{"text":"CI/CD project"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"C